# Sanctuary Fortress 09_cliff_temple layer 3: four Mekenobites (WLWK, CWallWalker; e0025009e starts
# inactive), each patrolling two AIWPs with flags 0x200 (Patrol's Generate arm). The player stands under
# e002500f9 (it shoots: ShouldShootProjectile/LaunchProjectiles), shoots its legs (u05fc/u05fd, the
# collision actors SetupCollisionManager makes) with the power beam and missiles (leg-hit reactions,
# mLegHitByMissile), then kills it (Dead, the grenade, Think's exploded arms). e0025014e dies to a
# charged dark shot (the IceXDamage arm), e00250156 to console damage. For tools/cov/specs/wallwalker.py.
@f300 god 1; layer 3; give missile 50; give chargeBeam 1; give darkBeam 1; give lightBeam 1; give annihilatorBeam 1
@f330 objs WallWalker
@f360 obj e002500f9
@f400 tp 100 20 -25
@f700 objs CollisionActor
@f720 shoot u05fd
@f760 obj e002500f9
@f900 shoot u05fc
@f940 obj e002500f9
@f1100 shoot u05fd missile
@f1140 obj e002500f9
@f1300 shoot u05fc missile
@f1340 obj e002500f9
@f1500 shoot u05fd missile; shoot u05fc missile
@f1540 obj e002500f9
@f1700 shoot e002500f9
@f1740 obj e002500f9
@f1800 objs Grenade
@f1900 obj e002500f9
@f2100 objs WallWalker
@f2200 tp 47 22 -30
@f2400 beam dark; shoot e0025014e charged
@f2440 obj e0025014e
@f2700 damage e00250156 10
@f2740 obj e00250156
@f2900 send e0025009e Activate
@f3000 obj e0025009e
@f3200 send e0025009e Delete
@f3300 objs WallWalker
